WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:08.090
Your money's not here.

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.090
It's on the blockchain.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.190
It's in Joe's transaction and Mrs. Macklin’s
transaction.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.379
It's a digital currency.

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:18.410
Run down to the market and buy the biggest
turkey in all of London!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.460
Then take it to Bob Cratchit's house.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.550
Do it fast and there's half a crown it for
you.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:24.550
Well is that it?

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:25.550
I'm sorry?

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.550
That's your contribution to society, huh?

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.650
Half a crown and a turkey?

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.409
I also donate to charity!

00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:32.730
Oh, great charity!

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:36.590
Where you get to decide
where your money goes!

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.590
Yes.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.590
Wow.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.890
Yes, after I pay federal and state and local
taxes;

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.149
the remaining money, I dictate where it goes
to.

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:46.970
That is so like the One Percent! it's people
like you who are

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:47.970
destroying America!

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.019
Or Britain... or wherever the hell we are.

00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:51.630
Do you donate money to charity, sir?

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.249
I raise awareness on Facebook.

00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:54.559
That doesn't sound like a real thing.

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:55.559
It's a real thing!

00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:57.410
Why don't you do that and volunteer at a soup
kitchen ?

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.649
I don't have time to volunteer because I'm
raising

00:00:58.649 --> 00:00:59.730
awareness on Facebook!

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:03.452
And when the shepherd saw the light in the
sky, they

00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:09.390
rejoiced with exceeding great joy, for the
Space X Falcon 9 rocket had successfully launched

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:13.399
the satellite into orbit and returned autonomously
to their platform.

00:01:13.399 --> 00:01:21.750
No no, I want an official Red Rider carbine
action 200 shot range model air rifle!

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.799
Sure, kid.

00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:24.170
We need these tariffs.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:27.350
Our trade deficit with the North Pole has
never been bigger.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:28.850
Santa is killing us on trade.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.000
He's killing us.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.130
There's a trade deficit between me and the
grocery store

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.799
that doesn't mean I need to have more taxes
on me buying groceries.

00:01:35.799 --> 00:01:38.149
Oh, hi.

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:43.119
[Off screen] Who is it?

00:01:43.119 --> 00:01:46.299
It's carol singers.

00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:50.539
[Music plays: Silent Night]

00:01:50.539 --> 00:01:55.110
...and paste him in a manger because there
was no room at the inn,

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:59.500
for the City Council had banned Airbnb as
anti-competitive.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.320
All these people are talking about Santa's
naughty list and

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.320
his nice list,

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:09.030
but it's his kill list that should concern
us!

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:25.030
[Music plays: Silent Night]

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:29.780
You've got a foreigner violating DC airspace

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.000
and you're telling me we don't need a wall?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.310
Listen kiddo, you're getting older and it's
time we had a talk.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:40.830
There's no such thing as Sanders.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.720
The man
is real, but the policies are just fantasy.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:49.140
It's something that we made up so that kids
and college sophomores would have something

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.360
to get excited about.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.660
You selfish undemocratic prick!

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.810
I don't understand what you want from me!

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:56.810
You have too much stuff!

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.810
Give us your stuff!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.280
The system which incentivizes me to
accumulate stuff also incentivizes me

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.460
to create wealth for you.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.460
Oh, well then, why are there poor people?

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.760
Abject poverty is the natural state of man.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:12.080
The question isn't why there are poor people,
it's why there are rich people.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.870
Just give me your stuff!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:14.870
No!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:16.410
Gahh, I am so going to picket this house.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.410
Huhaha!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.910
Good luck going to a
restaurant, buddy.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.380
We're going to be there.

